# USE WHEN exploring cognitive architecture, understanding system structure, or accessing meta-domain knowledge

# Meta Domain Reference

## Overview

This reference guide provides a comprehensive index of meta-domain knowledge in the 1000xbrain cognitive architecture. The meta domain includes files related to the architecture's structure, contribution standards, and self-understanding mechanisms.

## Key Meta Domain Components

| Component | Purpose | Primary Location |
|-----------|---------|------------------|
| Architecture | System structure and relationships | knowledge/rules/reference/architecture.md |
| Contributions | Standards for enhancing the system | knowledge/rules/patterns/doc/ |
| System Maps | Visualizations of system relationships | knowledge/rules/reference/maps/ |
| Self-Enhancement | Protocols for cognitive improvement | knowledge/rules/guides/ |

